%% Question: what are Loomarr's parts, and what does it talk to?
flowchart TB
  people([People: describe a channel, approve it]):::audience

  subgraph loomarr["Loomarr: one container, one database (SQLite or Postgres)"]
    direction LR
    suggest[Suggester]:::loomarr ==> build[Channel builder]:::loomarr ==> schedule[Scheduler]:::loomarr ==> playout[Playout]:::loomarr
    filler[Filler]:::loomarr --> schedule
  end

  subgraph services["What you already run"]
    direction LR
    tmdb[TMDB]:::service
    llm[LLM]:::service
    req[Seerr or *arr]:::service
    media[Emby or Jellyfin]:::service
  end

  screens([TVs and browsers: watch]):::audience

  people ==> suggest
  suggest --> tmdb
  suggest --> llm
  build --> req
  playout == Live TV ==> media
  media ==> screens

  class loomarr boundary
  class services zone
